  <item>
    <title>S1E03│为什么摇滚乐这么有活力</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6294d67483ddae2d9e72ad54</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6294d67483ddae2d9e72ad54</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 30 May 2022 14:36:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如果你问我</span></p><span></span><p><span>什么样的音乐最具有活力？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>那我一定会回答，当然是摇滚乐！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>到底什么是摇滚乐，你肯定听到过这样的说法</span></p><span></span><p><span>摇滚乐是愤怒、是叛逆、是自由、是态度、是一种精神</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>或者是看谁都不顺眼。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这种说法在不太听摇滚的听众之间广为流传。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从狭义上讲</span></p><span></span><p><span>摇滚乐制作理念：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 以个性化的方式追求市场</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 编曲or乐器和人声竞争</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. 简单直白的表达方式（“就是不转弯” ）</span></p><span></span><p><span>4.突出某一个元素，不局限于人声</span></p><span></span><p><span>5. 不介意表达模棱两可的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span>2019年的夏天，一个综艺《乐队的夏天》引爆了全网</span></p><span></span><p><span>让许多年轻人第一次接触到了这种音乐形式</span></p><span></span><p><span>他们沉醉于新裤子乐队的《你要跳舞吗》之中</span></p><span></span><p><span>肆意地摇晃自己的身体</span></p><span></span><p><span>也被痛仰乐队的一直往南方开所洗脑</span></p><span></span><p><span>但无法否认的是</span></p><span></span><p><span>当你听到吉他噪音又响起</span></p><span></span><p><span>你全身的细胞都会随之跳跃</span></p><span></span><p><span>也许当你走进音乐节</span></p><span></span><p><span>当你走进Livehouse的那一刻</span></p><span></span><p><span>你才能真正明白</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>为什么摇滚乐是最有活力的音乐</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvRQ2537BpU5otjVXwqlgYDDJN6K.mp3" length="11475103" type="audio/mpeg"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:04:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L2xsMnNValg5ODM3cE1oRXNTU3UyTERRSm9qUUYucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>S1E02│结婚的另一种方程式，没房+旅居也可以等于美好</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62612f375cc41f5cd4ee8bbb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62612f375cc41f5cd4ee8bbb</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 21 Apr 2022 10:17:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期，让我们来谈论下结婚。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你对结婚怎样理解?</span></p><span></span><p><span>它是一种契约?</span></p><span></span><p><span>它是一种对等关系?</span></p><span></span><p><span>它是爱情的终点?</span></p><span></span><p><span>似乎现在对于早已习惯快节奏生活的我们来说</span></p><span></span><p><span>只要谈起结婚</span></p><span></span><p><span>首先想到的是关于婚姻的束缚感</span></p><span></span><p><span>在日本电影《花束般的恋爱》中有这样一句台词</span></p><span></span><p><span>“开始意味着结束，世界上最稳定的关系就是没有关系”</span></p><span></span><p><span>这种悲观的话语总会让大家对于婚姻二字感觉有些沉重</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱情是爱情 婚姻是婚姻</span></p><span></span><p><span>二者本来是一种递进关系</span></p><span></span><p><span>而现在我们好像经常将它们区分开来</span></p><span></span><p><span>婚姻二字好像有些沉重</span></p><span></span><p><span>但其实也没那么沉重</span></p><span></span><p><span>我身边就有一对马上要结婚的情侣</span></p><span></span><p><span>他们决定不买房</span></p><span></span><p><span>他们决定包下一栋别墅只请五十位朋友参加婚礼</span></p><span></span><p><span>他们决定婚礼之后 搬去大理</span></p><span></span><p><span>一切听起来好像都是这么不合理</span></p><span></span><p><span>一切听起来好像都挺合理</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主要话题</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="431">07:11</a> 男生什么时候想结婚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="631">10:31</a> 爱情就像做饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="682">11:22</a> 女生什么时候想结婚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1013">16:53</a> 为什么想和他结婚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1483">24:43</a> 结婚一定要这么现实吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1713">28:33</a> “爱情都是从套路开始的”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1832">30:32</a> 亲密关系当中的“使命感”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2258">37:38</a> 一场“特别”的婚礼&amp;结婚要列“脑图”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2962">49:22</a> 去大理后的未来规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3238">53:58</a> 当我们在讨论结婚时，我们在讨论什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3662">1:01:02</a> 原生家庭对我们的影响有多大？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《Reminiscence 》 Chelsea McGough</span></p><span></span><p><span>《带我去找夜生活》告五人</span></p><span></span><p><span>《想着你》郭顶</span></p><span></span><p><span>《让我坠入爱的漩涡》大张伟</span></p><span></span><p><span>《All about Anna》 昨夜派对（L.N Party）</span></p><span></span><p><span>《揪心的玩笑与漫长的白日梦》万能青年旅店</span></p><span></span><p><span>《we just call it love》肆囍乐队</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqHUCfJfHgvbODuuNJJqrRdwKfsw.m4a" length="106297240" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z0ZTlFYW1scXMwY2dNS3dRenAyTWZOa0RVUkIucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
